fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-pr3)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">分层响应试验</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">各层注入量与响应</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">试验批次切分</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">完整试验批次留出</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">分层二次代理</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">拟合三层二次响应</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">等量均分</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">各层平分给定总量</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"3\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">总量能容纳？无可行解则调整</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">配额与上限复核</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">守恒与分层上限</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">三层注水配额</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">可行方案的配额与收益</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">同约束响应收益</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">同约束的预测收益</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S1｜一行是某层某批的一次响应试验</h3><div class=\"teaching-figure\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"横向滚动阅读图解\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 S1｜一行是某层某批的一次响应试验\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"290\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f6f3\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\"><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">层</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">训练批次/条数</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">测试批次/条数</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">单位</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"56\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#dcebe5\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">A</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">4 / 80</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">2 / 40</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">m³/d → 指数</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"99\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e8eee6\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">B</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">4 / 80</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">2 / 40</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">m³/d → 指数</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"142\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#dcebe5\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">C</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">4 / 80</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">2 / 40</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">m³/d → 指数</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>同批不跨集合；响应指数只用于教学优化，不能直接换成现场增产。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S2｜相同增量水，在曲线不同处价值不同</h3><div class=\"teaching-figure\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"横向滚动阅读图解\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 S2｜相同增量水，在曲线不同处价值不同\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"290\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f6f3\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M65 225L670 225\" stroke=\"#819b9c\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M65 60L65 225\" stroke=\"#819b9c\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">累计响应指数（概念坐标）</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">单层注水 / m³/d →（概念坐标）</text><polyline points=\"65,225 239.0,150.0 413.0,112.5 645,105.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#237d73\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#237d73\">A：初期陡、后期平</text><polyline points=\"65,225 239.0,192.0 413.0,160.5 645,130.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6479b4\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#6479b4\">C：初期缓、仍有增量空间</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>边际响应是曲线的斜率：增加少量注水带来的响应增量。演示画出三层实际拟合曲线。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S3｜两个配额决定第三个；总量不能凭空增减</h3><div class=\"teaching-figure\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"横向滚动阅读图解\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 S3｜两个配额决定第三个；总量不能凭空增减\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"290\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f6f3\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\"><path d=\"M70 225L340 225\" stroke=\"#819b9c\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M70 225L70 50\" stroke=\"#819b9c\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M70 50L340 225\" stroke=\"#819b9c\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><polygon points=\"70,125 180,125 205,145 205,225 70,225\" fill=\"#d9e8dd\"/><text x=\"355\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">A + B + C = 总量</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"129\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">C = 总量 − A − B</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"171\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">各层配额 ≤ 本层上限</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">枚举步长：5 m³/d</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"259\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">A 层配额 →</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#284b55\">B 层配额 ↑</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>三角形示意 A、B 非负且 A+B≤总量；绿色只示意一部分可行域，实际筛除三个层上限后以演示散点为准。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S4｜先核对守恒，再谈增益</h3><div class=\"teaching-figure\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"横向滚动阅读图解\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 S4｜先核对守恒，再谈增益\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"290\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f6f3\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\"><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">方案</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">A</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">B</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">C</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"56\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#dcebe5\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">讲解均分</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">60</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">60</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">60</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"99\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e8eee6\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">总量核对</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">60+60+60</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">=</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">180 m³/d</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"142\" width=\"690\" height=\"37\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#dcebe5\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">若 A 上限为20</text><text x=\"192.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">均分不可行</text><text x=\"362.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">不报告相对增益</text><text x=\"532.0\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#284b55\">调整后重算</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>当前候选表显示所有前排方案的完整 A/B/C 配额；鼠标悬停散点可查看同一个 A 配额下 B/C 的不同分法。</figcaption></figure>"
